{"id":"vod_sn_39021","vodId":"39021","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"骚动时节的少女们啊","name_cn":"骚动时节的少女们啊","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/554f0656cc0a010ec4af2958edd53e67.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生于某所高中的文艺部内。很轻易就陷入妄想之中的小野寺和纱（河野日和 配音）、总是不经意之间做出惊人发言的菅原新菜（安济知佳 配音）、恋爱经历为零，异常单纯的文学少女须藤百百子（麻仓桃 配音）、想要创作属于自己的小说的本乡一叶（黑泽朋世 配音）和性格非常古板，对性的话题避之而不及的社长曾根崎莉香（上坂堇 配音），隶属于文艺部的是这五名性格迥异的部员。　　一天，大家正在讨论“死前想要做的事情”这一话题，平日里默默无闻的新菜突然暴言“想要体会一下性爱”，这句突如其来的发言让整个文艺部都陷入了混乱之中，少女们虽然对这句话的反映各异，但她们的心都被次撩动了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1m341jBJJM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rARK5Bdcdf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aVNqTR4idZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uDzeQADvHQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZyHZZjvyBR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XNR0x5X21z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yUb5jgXFE81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L89n789WK21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k9k78L0Kce1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VSThMB8GWE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eULZZXnSpe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Te7bCrW5SN1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:51.494Z"}